      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُثْمِرٌ</span></b> : see 4; and see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَمْرَآءُ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقْلٌ مُثْمِرٌ</span>
(assumed tropical:)  [<i>Fruitful intellect;</i>] the <i>intellect of the Muslim:</i>
opposed to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقْلٌ عَقِيمٌ</span> [barren intellect;] the intel-lect of the unbeliever. (M, TA.)

